stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pulled: Partner pulls saved list
  Pulled --> Pending: IDs resolve and revision is new
  Pending --> Partial: Partner chooses some properties
  Partial --> Partial: Partner chooses more properties
  Partial --> Accepted: Partner resolves remaining differences
  Pending --> Accepted: Partner uses client list
  Partial --> Accepted: Partner uses client list
  Pending --> Dismissed: Partner keeps own list
  Partial --> Dismissed: Partner keeps remaining own choices
  Pending --> Superseded: Newer saved list arrives
  Partial --> Superseded: Newer saved list arrives
%% never Pulling changes the partner shortlist
%% never A portal actor accepts a proposal
%% never An unresolved property is matched by name
